\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0    Just one thing is very needful;
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0  That is what Mary has chosen
\par With all my heart and all my mind,
\par I will search for and make it mine.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  This thing was embedded in Christ.
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 So pricelesss, so invaluable;
\par Obtained only in Jesus Christ,
\par  The only sure way to heaven.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  I am sore blind, I know nothing;
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 I yearn for your Holy Spirit;
\par Which leads me 'long the sure safe way,
\par And make my life fitting to God.
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.   Create in me a clear conscience,
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 As you consider to be pure;
\par May I listen to your good news
\par That teaches us your holy ways.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.  O Jesus Christ, my true master,
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 By the power of your pious blood
\par Has cleansed my body of my sins
\par \pard     And brought me closer unto you.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

